# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository (SPEC.md §10.13 assumes
# EOL-normalized content; Windows checkouts get LF too, keeping parser inputs
# and git diffs byte-stable across platforms).
* text=auto eol=lf
# Windows batch scripts break under cmd.exe with LF-only endings
# (M3 Capacitor templates will bring gradlew.bat).
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
